# Normalize line endings on commit/checkout.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows silently converts LF
# files to CRLF in the working tree, which biome (default `lineEnding: lf`)
# flags as format errors. Pinning `eol=lf` here overrides the user's
# autocrlf setting for tracked text files, so the working tree matches
# the committed blob on every platform.
#
# `text=auto` lets git auto-detect text vs binary; only text files get
# the EOL conversion. Binary blobs keep whatever bytes the contributor
# committed.
* text=auto eol=lf
